Laya Snake for Windows

This independent Windows adaptation includes software from:

  mizorewww/laya-mlx
  https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx
  Copyright 2026 laya-mlx contributors. Apache-2.0.

upstream/game.py retains the original game and cycle safety planner.
upstream/policy.py retains the original prompt construction and decision method;
its constructor and imports were adapted for injectable Windows/API backends.
Source was retrieved on 2026-09-21. Original notices are in upstream/NOTICE.

The browser interface, local server, persistent process adapter, JEV adapter,
comparison controller, Windows launcher, and configuration guide were added or
adapted on 2026-09-21.

Laya models are by Convai Innovations and contributors:
  https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya

ggmlc and its Laya executable are a separate project, downloaded by users:
  https://github.com/monatis/ggmlc

TypeSafe JEV is accessed through its API and is not bundled with this source.
This project is not an official release of laya-mlx, ggmlc, or TypeSafe.
